This source code contains the routines and a test program for
the Real-time Equatorial Electric Field Model (RTEEF).

To compile the source code, you need to have installed the GNU
Scientific Library. Then, simply type 'make' in the directory
and it should compile the test program 'rteef'. rteef will then
prompt the user to enter times and a location and will then
output a data file of EEF values.

For questions, contact:
